<title>CHINA: Chevalier Dev yearly net jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Chevalier Dev yearly net jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   21.5	 vs  2.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.0	  vs  1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  33.65 gain vs  84.45 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    109.32     vs  12.38</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,601.50   vs  2,721.08</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chevalier Development International</p>
<p>				     Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 15-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Chevalier Development engages in property investment and development, construction, civil engineering and the supply and installation of building materials and equipment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$33.65 million from write back of provision for diminution in value of investment in a property joint venture project.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is 7.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.5 cents) vs 4.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
